   "answer": "Task-CoEvolve reduces total search time by about half for both models: from 22.2 to 11.5 hours for GPT-5.6 Luna and from 38.0 to 20.5 hours for Qwen3.6-35B-A3B. The two fixed costs that limit further time reduction are candidate proposal by the meta-agent (taking 2.4–3.3 hours regardless of evaluation budget) and the 10-way parallelism of trials, which makes search time depend on the longest-running tasks rather than the number of evaluated tasks. [3:25]"
