   "answer": "WikiSkill's knowledge and tracking layers consist of the Wiki Layer (wiki/) and the Skill Layer (skills/). The Wiki Layer is updated by the Wiki Maintainer, which consolidates execution traces into structured knowledge, while the Skill Layer is updated by the Skill Proposer, which proposes skill updates based on the wiki and traces [5:11][5:12]."
  },
