   "answer": "WikiSkill applies a stratified sampling strategy per iteration that samples up to 8 traces, stratified into a maximum of 5 failing traces for root-cause analysis and up to 3 passing traces to identify effective strategies and prevent regressions. Each individual execution log is capped at 15,000 characters before injection into the prompt for the Wiki Maintainer's diagnostic feedback. [5:56]"
